Proposed components: embodied-response-instruction/0.1-draft;
embodied-task-options/0.1-draft; embodied-task-reasons/0.1-draft;
embodied-task-arbitration/0.1-draft; embodied-choice-expression/0.1-draft;
embodied-protocol-attempt/0.1-draft. Existing body mathematics and task source
mathematics retain their exact accepted versions.

Sources inspected: TASK_COGNITIVE_PATH and its whole-shape review; the accepted
component manifest and allocation table; CAMPAIGN2_TASK_PLAN_AND_OPTIONS_DRAFT;
CAMPAIGN2_COGNITIVE_STATE_AND_OCCURRENCE_CLOSURE_DRAFT; cognitiveTransforms,
cognitiveMath, cognitiveChoice, cognitiveArbitration, cognitiveState and execution;
the accepted EMB contracts and the qualified current source/profile. Earlier DRAFT
labels in task component documents retain their manifest-governed accepted meaning.

Use the existing data-only nine-field model source: the six version strings plus
content, registry and parameter bytes. Proposed versions are
rules/campaign3-embodied-receiving/0.1-draft;
campaign3-embodied-receiving-registry/0.1-draft;
content/0.2-candidate; campaign3-embodied-receiving-parameters/0.1-draft;
numeric/embodied-receiving-exact/0.1-draft; and the unchanged
rng/sha256-addressed-128-v1-candidate. No caller semantic function, source generator,
world callback, body path or dynamic rules dictionary is admitted.
